Syntax: debride <item>

With the proper tools, a trained warrior has the ability to remove
rust from metal equipment. Debriding metal equipment requires a high
degree of focus and attention to detail, lest the item be damaged.

The appropriate tool must be held in your primary hand and the item
you wish to debride must be in your inventory in order to debride
it.

Only rusty metal equipment can be debrided using this skill.

Tool necessary:
     Primary:   file

Debriding rust from an item will require a decent amount of time to
complete, and the amount is proportional to how large the object is.
